29e19d6f6\">           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Scope of Graduate Recruitment Majors：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri; font-size:14px;\">Instrument Science, Optics, Physics, Mechanical Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Control Science and Engineering, Computer Science and Technology</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Doctoral Recruitment：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri; font-size:14px;\">Annually enrolls 2-3 full-time doctoral students via national unified examination.</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Flexible overseas study opportunities are provided based on personal intentions and team needs, including programs supported by the China Scholarship Council (CSC), short-term visiting studies, and international exchange programs.</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Master</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">s Recruitment： </span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px; font-family:Calibri;\">Annually enrolls 3 master</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\">’</span><span style=\"font-size:14px; font-family:Calibri;\">s students.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3003\"></i><em data-editor=\"0\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3003\">工作经历</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"add\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl>        <ol id=\"85dfc51c1b98cdbed88ef78dff1f2aac\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"标题\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           Professor，Doctoral Supervisor          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"workplace\" data-zh=\"工作单位\">           workplace          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"position\" data-zh=\"职位/职称\">           position          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           Director of the Institute of Optoelectronic Measurement and Control          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"all time\" data-zh=\"起讫时间\">           all time          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           introduction          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           July 1998 - July 2000Teaching Assistant, Department of Automatic Testing and Control, HITAugust 2000 - July 2004Lecturer, Department of Automatic Testing and Control, HITAugust 2004 - July 2008Associate Professor, Department of Automatic Testing and Control, HITAugust 2008 - PresentProfessor, Department of Automatic Testing and Control, HITApril 2010 - PresentDoctoral Supervisor, Department of Automatic Testing and Control, HITOctober 2004 - October 2009Deputy Director, Institute of Optoelectronic Measurement, Control and Intelligence, HITNovember 2009 - PresentDirector, Institute of Optoelectronic Measurement, Control and Intelligence, HITDecember 2010 - July 2011Assistant Dean, School of Electrical Engineering and Automation, HITAugust 2011 - December 2018Vice Dean, School of Electrical Engineering and Automation, HITDecember 2014 - December 2015Visiting Scholar, National Physical Laboratory (NPL), UK          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"3001\">基本信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"76d89e97a6e4ba3de9065ba18206b430\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"fd3117d50d97a75bd34b60f6d83bc4d2\">           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">He serves as the Deputy Commander of the HIT Project Team for National Major Projects. He has hosted and participated in over 80 projects, including sub-projects of National Major Projects, projects funded by the National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC), provincial-ministerial level key projects, and horizontal cooperation projects. He has published more than 50 academic papers and filed over 30 invention patents.</span></span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3004\"></i><em data-editor=\"0\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3004\">教育经历</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"add\"><i cl