iv>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           Harbin Institute of Technology          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"education\" data-zh=\"学历\">           education          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           introduction          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>        <ol id=\"3669840236231d70f3d9f9c77208f754\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"标题\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           Bachelor of Science          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"all time\" data-zh=\"起讫时间\">           all time          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           September 1992 - July 1996          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"major\" data-zh=\"所学专业\">           major          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           Department of Applied Physics          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"learning institution\" data-zh=\"学习机构\">           learning institution          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           Harbin Institute of Technology          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"education\" data-zh=\"学历\">           education          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           introduction          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3101\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"3101\">研究领域</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"e25c63de865b317e7f65e350b03241a6\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"36d4509776dcd4389e233d338fd7aace\">           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri; font-size:14px; text-wrap:wrap;\">Research Focus：</span></span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Machine Vision and Artificial Intelligence</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Laser Precision Measurement Technology</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Precision Instrumentation and Testing Technology</span></span></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">For years, focusing on the national major needs of Inertial Confinement Fusion (ICF) and the academic frontiers of precision measurement, research has been conducted in the fields of precision optical measurement, sensing, and intelligentization, mainly including:</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Machine Vision and Artificial Intelligence: Research on machine vision and artificial intelligence technologies to achieve target detection, recognition, localization, and precision measurement.</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Laser Precision Measurement Technology: Research on lidar 3D measurement technology, laser interferometric surface topography measurement technology, laser vibration measurement technology, and laser displacement sensing technology.</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">Precision Instrumentation and Testing Technology: Research on optoelectronic precision measurement and sensing methods, as well as instrument design and development.</span></span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"> </span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:宋体; font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\"><br></span></span><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(248, 174, 122);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3002\"></i><em data-editor=\"0\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3002\">荣誉称号</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"add\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl>        <ol id=\"08bfc5333c7eb1808fcbc9fa85065ffd\" class=\"rych\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">       